{title: I am determined, I’ve made up my mind}
{x_source: docx:1. Incomplete/I am determined, I’ve made up my mind.docx}

{comment: Chorus}
I am determined, I’ve made up my mind
I’ll serve the Lord
I am determined, I’ve made up my mind
I’ll serve the Lord

{comment: Bridge}
For I will follow wherever He leadeth,
I’ll pasture wherever He feedeth.
I am determined, I’ve made up my mind
I’ll serve the Lord
